# tests/

Integration tests and test fixtures for the server, covering entry/index services, server startup with TLS and JWT auth, and logging initialization. Tests use shared Postgres containers (via MaybeOnceAsync) and Hydra for OAuth2 testing. Supporting fixtures include TLS certificates and JWT keys.

## Dirs

- `certs/` -- Self-signed TLS certificates for local HTTPS testing; includes CA and server keys
- `jwt/` -- ECDSA P-256 key pairs for JWT signing/verification; includes good and bad keys for testing

## Files

- `server_integration_tests.rs` -- Full-stack server tests with TLS, JWT auth, and Hydra OAuth2 integration
- `entry_service_integration_tests.rs` -- Entry service integration tests with shared Postgres and index initialization
- `index_service_integration_tests.rs` -- Index service integration tests with test claims injection and datastore fixtures
- `auth_server.rs` -- OAuth2 client registration and token exchange helper for Hydra (test-only, included in server tests)
- `logging_init_tests.rs` -- Tests verifying global tracing subscriber installation and idempotency
- `logging_not_initialised_test.rs` -- Isolated test confirming no subscriber is set before init_tracing() runs
